WEBVTT

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:19.820
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:23.340
Kono hiroi sekai no naka

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:28.520
Deaubeki hitotachi ga

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:35.100
Mado no mukou niji no mukou ni mieru

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.730
Kizuite iru hazu

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:45.840
Kyuukutsu na omori o nuide

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:48.810
Kimochi o yurushite

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:56.120
Saa mimi o sumashi sono toki o matte

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:58.880
Ima mezamenasai

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:12.200
Oozora ni egaita chiisa na
yume o taisetsu ni shiyou

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:19.440
Sou sureba itsumo shiawase ni nareru

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:22.210
Kitto

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:26.580
Woh woh

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:37.390
Welcome!

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:39.760
Would you like me to warm up
this boxed lunch for you?

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:42.500
Uh... yeah, sure, please.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:44.570
And I'd like one sweet roll, too, please.

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:48.270
I'm terribly sorry, but I just put
those in the warmer...

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:51.410
But, if you'd like one of our new
soy flour rolls, we've got plenty!

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:52.710
Okay, I'll have one of those...

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:54.570
Thank you very much!

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:56.150
Back again!

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:58.110
Ah, good to see you!

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:02.350
A lot of magazines come out on Mondays.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:06.290
It's a pain because I gotta restock
all the boxed lunches then, too.

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:09.560
And then I get a guy who orders a
sweet roll at a time like this...

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:11.460
What the heck is he thinking?

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:14.000
Oh, well, no point grumbling about it.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.200
This is all so I can survive another day...

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.000
Umm...
This is all so I can survive another day...

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:17.620
Umm...

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:21.700
Umm, is that boxed lunch ready yet?

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:25.070
"Now that I think about it,

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:28.530
what the hell am I doing here anyway?!"

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:33.700
Uh, Miss, I'm still waiting on that
soy flour roll, too, and...

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:39.610
Whoa, Marlie! I need ya to sign for this!
You need to sign the receipt!

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:45.660
Ah! Do Demons Have Any Dignity?!

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:48.530
IDIOTS!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:53.070
I am the Lady Marller, Demon First Class,
Unlimited License!

00:02:53.070 --> 00:02:55.840
What is the Office of Demonic
Affair's #1 employee

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:58.540
doing working at a convenience store?!

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:00.880
For 1020 yen an hour?!

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:04.850
Why a 20% wage boost for the
midnight to 6 AM shift?!

00:03:04.850 --> 00:03:09.450
That's a whole 170-yen increase from 850/hr!

00:03:09.450 --> 00:03:14.360
Well, you see, the owner of the store
told me I've got potential.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.190
Way to go, Lady Marller!

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:18.560
Could we expect any less of the Office
of Demonic Affair's #1 employee?!

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:21.430
Oh, stop it. Hey, get this: The owner also said,

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:25.600
"I could probably even let you
handle managing this place"!

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.430
Congratulations on your promotion to manager!

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:33.140
And please keep on bringing us these
delicious boxed lunches!

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:34.810
Hey, you just leave it to me!

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.180
No, wait a minute!

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:39.580
I'm ASKING you how the heck
I ended up like this!

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:44.150
Well, that was because you, uh,
blew so many of your missions...

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:45.550
Excuse me?

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:47.890
I mean, it was because our R&D
wasn't good enough!

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:49.160
Exactly!

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:53.190
So now that you got that, get right to work
on your next invention!

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:55.430
With all due respect, Lady Marller,

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:57.970
that is going to be QUITE difficult with
the equipment we have now.

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:00.440
I think it may be best if we were to return
to the demon realm once more...

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:04.310
Imbecile! If I go back now,
I'll be a laughing stock!

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:07.500
And the ruler of demonkind wouldn't
tolerate it in the first place...

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.350
You mean... Lady Hild?

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:14.220
Don't say that name!

00:04:14.220 --> 00:04:16.350
Just hearing it gives me the shivers.

00:04:16.350 --> 00:04:18.750
Oh God, she's so scary!

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:20.420
Enjoying the part-time job?

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:24.630
Oh, I am totally set now!
I could become the manager.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.600
I'm stoked!

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:31.960
I'd just LOVE to have a boxed lunch that
you've heated up for me, Marlie!

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:34.560
L-LADY HILD?!

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:36.540
P-Please accept my humblest apologies!

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:37.010
This convenience store boxed
lunch isn't bad at all.
P-Please accept my humblest apologies!

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:39.710
This convenience store boxed
lunch isn't bad at all.
I had not even the foggiest notion
that you'd still be in this world!

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.140
I had not even the foggiest notion
that you'd still be in this world!

00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:44.810
I can't say I'm surprised you didn't notice me,
even though I'm sitting right next to you.

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:46.750
You're so thickheaded.

00:04:46.750 --> 00:04:48.250
B-But...

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:49.620
What, this?

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:53.520
I split off 1/1000 of myself
just before I went back.

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:56.290
After all, there's still some stuff
I need to take care of here.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.530
Is that right?

00:04:58.530 --> 00:05:01.460
So how's increasing our shares coming?

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:05.830
Of course you're not going to tell me you
haven't made ANY progress, now are you?

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.400
Um, well...

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:15.880
You sure it's all right to let those goddesses
go around doing whatever they please?

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:17.880
N-Not at all!

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.620
Marller, First Class, Unlimited License...

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:24.090
I'd say I know your power better than anyone.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.550
L-Lady Hild!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:29.220
If you really put your mind to it, you'd be able to
do in those goddesses right away, wouldn't you?

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:31.830
Of... Of course, Lady Hild!

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:37.420
Then it's high time you showed those goddesses
why they should fear you. Right?

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:39.070
YES, MA'AM!

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:41.530
All right, I'm gonna do it now!

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:57.690
Belldandy?

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.750
Have you seen my blue jacket around?

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:03.990
Oh, I washed it just yesterday.

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:05.890
Wait just one moment...

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:08.630
Oh... it's all right. I'll go get it myself!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.000
Darn right you will!

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.040
I won't put up with you having my sister
go fetch YOUR laundry!

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.300
So you're going to go at them head-on, eh?
I won't put up with you having my sister
go fetch YOUR laundry!

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:15.200
So you're going to go at them head-on, eh?

00:06:15.200 --> 00:06:20.210
Yes, ma'am! When you really think about it,
I am feared even in the demon realm.

00:06:20.210 --> 00:06:25.110
When I get serious, a mere
goddess or two is nothing!

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.710
Don't you worry one bit about me!

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:32.110
I guess it makes no difference to me.
Okay, it's your show then.

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.530
Just you watch, you stinkin' goddesses.

00:06:36.530 --> 00:06:38.620
Booster demon, Senbei! Let's go!

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:43.600
You like, called. And like, out I come...

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:45.700
SHAKKIN!

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:46.970
Let's do it!

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:50.610
Leave it all to Senbei.
You've got nothing to fear!

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:52.300
It's showtime!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.740
TARIKI HONGAN TEMPLE

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:09.480
It's been a while, so I totally forgot
about that thing...

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:13.860
Damn! Well, a little thing like this
isn't going to slow ME down!

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:17.030
I say, this wasabi is simply sublime!

00:07:17.030 --> 00:07:18.330
My word... What on Earth is this?!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.640
Wha... Oh, no! My booster demon!
My word... What on Earth is this?!

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:20.190
Wha... Oh, no! My booster demon!

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:23.430
Blimey, it's an OCTOPUS!
The so-called "devil fish"!

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:26.740
Wait! That's mine! Give it back!

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:28.540
Oh, my God!

00:07:28.540 --> 00:07:31.280
Surely the owner of this ghastly devil fish
is the incarnation of Death, herself!

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:32.920
Haha, devil indeed!

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:33.580
Let's jam, Pete!
Haha, devil indeed!

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:34.250
Let's jam, Pete!
Okay, Roger!

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:34.720
Okay, Roger!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.840
Oh, my... what beautiful music!

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.890
What'd they have to do that for?

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:46.930
Damn it! If this is how it is,
Senbei's all I've got left to rely on!

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:47.950
SENBEI!

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:49.460
Shakkin!

00:07:50.600 --> 00:07:56.240
Leave it to me, and I'll make it look
like taking candy from a baby!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:59.000
I'm counting on you, Senbei!
She's your target.

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:04.510
Locked on target!

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:08.450
She's no match for my bad vibes! Shakkin!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:11.290
Oh, no, sorry! I botched it!

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:13.960
I told you SHE'S the target!

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:16.260
I am fully aware of that, milady!

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:18.460
Just a case of bad timing!

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:19.720
Shakkin!

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:22.260
Sorry, sorry, so sorry!

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:22.930
You sonnuva...
Sorry, sorry, so sorry!

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:24.430
You sonnuva...
You see, I've got a chronic case of hay fever...

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:25.100
You see, I've got a chronic case of hay fever...

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.270
What the hell are you talking about?!
You see, I've got a chronic case of hay fever...

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.000
What the hell are you talking about?!

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:29.510
Hey, it's just a plain, old pollen allergy, y'know?

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:31.230
You gotta tell me these things first!

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:36.000
Shakkin! Shakkin! Shakkin!

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.410
I'm safe.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.420
What is with you?
Those sneezes were totally forced!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.920
It was an act of God, I tell you!
When you sneeze, you go "Achoo". "ACHOO!"
Why the heck do you go "shakkin" anyway?!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:49.190
When you sneeze, you go "Achoo". "ACHOO!"
Why the heck do you go "shakkin" anyway?!

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:51.630
What, do you mean shakkin, as in
the Japanese word for "debt"?

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.300
You borrowing from a demonic bank?
Mortgage?

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:54.700
Did the collapse of the bubble economy
leave you down and out?!

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:57.970
Oh, no! Now I'm talking funny! Someone help me!
And what's the deal with talking funny
like those guys we ran into earlier?

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:58.670
Oh, no! Now I'm talking funny! Someone help me!
I'll bet you're in cahoots with them!

00:08:58.670 --> 00:08:59.730
I'll bet you're in cahoots with them!

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:03.230
I... I forgot about him.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:09.800
Oh, dear... Banpei's got a lot of energy today!

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:13.880
Marlie really is hopeless, isn't she?

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:16.820
She's not going to get anywhere like this...

00:09:17.650 --> 00:09:19.120
Guess I have no choice.

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:25.160
I'll never, ever rely on those two again.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:28.930
But now I've got nothing left. What can I do?

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:33.400
Huh? This is the heretical pot!
What's it doing here?

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:38.640
Hey, what do I care?
This is a devil-given chance for me!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.540
I'm not going to miss the opportunity!

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:42.240
Well, I'll be back later.

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:45.380
What time will you be back?

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:48.010
I don't think I'll be back that late...

00:09:49.550 --> 00:09:50.190
Marller?!

00:09:50.190 --> 00:09:50.890
Say your prayers, Belldandy! Take THIS!
Marller?!

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.150
Say your prayers, Belldandy! Take THIS!

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.060
Keiichi!

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:56.730
Fool! I totally expected you to do that!
Are you all right?

00:09:56.730 --> 00:09:58.560
Fool! I totally expected you to do that!

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:03.420
Belldandy!

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:06.060
I'm gonna split your personality up!

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:09.130
Now, what will we get?

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:11.040
Belldandy!

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:15.940
Nothing happened.

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:16.910
Huh?

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:18.880
WHAT GIVES?!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.120
That is the heretical pot, there's no doubt!

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:23.990
There's no way you should have made it out of
that all right! What the heck is going on here?

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.520
What a dope.

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.960
I'm half-goddess and half-demon,
so that's one thing,

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:31.760
but there's just no point using
something like that on Belldandy.

00:10:31.760 --> 00:10:33.960
Huh? What do you mean?

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:37.000
Cuz she doesn't even HAVE a
split personality to begin with!

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:37.970
Ooh!

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:40.600
Ah, so that's it, huh?

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:46.530
Hey, listen... I've been meaning to tell
you this, but you have got NO talent.

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:50.980
As a demon, you've simply got no talent.

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:53.080
Inside, you must realize that, right?

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:55.180
Why don't you just give up and
go back to the demon realm?

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:58.850
Hey, there are some things that are okay
to say and some that AREN'T!

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:02.460
You might not think it by looking at me, but I
happen to be First Class, Unlimited License.

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:04.190
I'm more awesome than you think!

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:06.130
I have a good relationship with
my subordinates, too,

00:11:06.130 --> 00:11:09.030
and... and... I'm gonna be manager at
the convenience store real soon!

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:11.330
I make 1020 yen an hour!

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:14.630
So telling me that...
that I've got no talent is just...

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:18.100
it's... it's so...

00:11:18.770 --> 00:11:20.610
C'mon, don't cry.

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:23.610
Oh, my! That's the job I got you...

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:25.850
So that's how things have been going then?

00:11:25.850 --> 00:11:30.350
Yeah. Thanks, Bell, you were a real lifesaver!

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:33.860
Well then let's celebrate your
promotion to manager!

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:34.560
Huh?

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:38.630
We'll be having a nice, big hot pot tonight.
It'll be even tastier if we all eat together.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:40.390
Oh, Bell!

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:45.930
But is there REALLY such thing as
a one-sided personality?

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:51.430
Every goddess has a hint or two of evil
somewhere deep down inside.

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:54.630
I'm glad I decided to put her to the test.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:58.910
Yes, I guess Bell really does
resemble him most of all.

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:01.680
This could be entertaining...

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:04.420
So please, stop crying.

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:06.820
Let's all get along and have a nice celebration.

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:24.970
Wow, I'm STUFFED!
That Belldandy is something else!

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.680
She's got the cooking ability of a
First Class goddess, that's for sure!

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:30.510
It's not the healthiest to be eating
boxed lunches all the time either!

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:34.280
Man, those goddesses are a
nicer bunch than I expected.

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:36.980
Tellin' me I could come over again
whenever I like! Aw, shucks...

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:39.290
Welcome back!

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:42.420
L-L-Lady Hild! What are you DOING?!

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:45.130
It's no fair if only you get to
have a hot pot tonight.

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:47.100
So I'm gonna make my own.

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:50.600
I beg your forgiveness!
I won't ever fail you like this again!

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.600
It's not that big a deal.

00:12:52.600 --> 00:12:55.570
If you're satisfied, then I'm happy, too.

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:57.910
I'm not satisfied by any means, milady!

00:12:57.910 --> 00:13:00.240
But you're full, aren't you?

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.980
Ah, well...

00:13:01.980 --> 00:13:03.550
Well, I am starving!

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:04.210
Lady Hild! Lady Hild, please wait!
Well, I am starving!

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:06.150
Lady Hild! Lady Hild, please wait!

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:08.520
I have a secret weapon I've
saved for a time like this!

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:10.590
By all means, please let me use it!

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:11.590
Really?

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:14.280
Y-Yes, I mean it!
Look, I've got it right here!

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:18.030
This is it! The ultimate anti-goddess
weapon: The devilish divinity vac!

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:20.500
Those goddesses are the biggest threat
to us increasing our share,

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.430
and with this we can seal them all away
in one fell swoop! It's great!

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:24.830
Try it out.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:25.630
Huh?

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.070
Try it out now!

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:28.760
Y-YES MA'AM!

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:35.180
Do it already!

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:41.150
Please let me out of here quick!

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:42.650
How do I do that?

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:45.220
Pour hot water over the lamp,
